  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/P1730747.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(159 fotos) L&#39;&#39;alumnat de l&#39;Escoleta de Nadal organitzada per l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda ha visitat aquest dimecres el Betlem de la Caixa Rural i l&#39;&#39;exposici&oacute; adjunta del legat de Julio Salvatierra.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/P1730892.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Despr&eacute;s, al Pla, han pogut entregar a la patge reial Asunsi&oacute;n les cartes amb els seus millors desitjos per a 2018.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730724.jpg\" alt=\"p1730724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730725.jpg\" alt=\"p1730725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730726.jpg\" alt=\"p1730726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730727.jpg\" alt=\"p1730727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730728.jpg\" alt=\"p1730728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730729.jpg\" alt=\"p1730729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletanadalvisitabetlemcaixarural/p1730730.jpg\" alt=\"p1730730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a